We arrive at the coffee shop and Aoi helps me order a cup of tea for myself and for her. #id:1d0
The three of you sit down #id:1d1

~ change_expression("Ayumi", "ph")

main_character: {FriendName} Told me she'll be here soon. #id:1d2

Ayumi (Smile): Okay! #id:1d3

main_character: So, だいじょうぶ　? #id:1d4

~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Sad")
