Ayumi (Sad): I told my friends… like you said. #id:1d6
~ change_expression("Aoi", "p")
Ayumi (Neutral): And most of them were excited about it. #id:1d7
~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Sad")
Ayumi (Sad): Except one friend. #id:1d8

main_character: What did they say? #id:1d9

Ayumi (Sad): He said it's childish, and that I have to grow up now that I'm a college student… #id:1da

~ animate("Ayumi", "pulse")
main_character: バカ です よ! #id:1db

~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Confused")
Ayumi (Confused): なに? #id:1dc

main_character: Oh I meant he's an idiot. Sorry #id:1dd
main_character: ごめんなさい #id:1de

~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Smile")
Ayumi (Smile): Oh, it's okay. #id:1df

main_character: But why would he say that? #id:1e0
main_character: Did he mock you? #id:1e1

~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Sad")
Ayumi (Sad): He didn't mock me… #id:1e2
Ayumi (Sad): But I thought he'd be happy for me, you know? #id:1e3
Ayumi (Sad): Instead of being weirded out. #id:1e4

main_character: I see. #id:1e5
main_character: But the rest of your friends were supportive, no? #id:1e6

Ayumi (Neutral): Yeah, it's just... #id:1e7
Ayumi (Sad): It reminded me of when I was little... #id:1e8

main_character: What do you mean? #id:1e9

// --- flashback / backstory ---
Ayumi (Sad): When I was little, I wanted to be a singer… #id:1ea
Ayumi (Sad): I wasn't the best, but… I tried #id:1eb
~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Smile")
Ayumi (Smile): And I was really happy doing so. #id:1ec
Ayumi (Smile): And my parents both supported me. #id:1ed
~ change_expression("Ayumi", "Sad")
Ayumi (Sad): But my best friend at the time, he… #id:1ee

main_character: He? #id:1ef

Ayumi (Sad): There was a ongaku happyokai at school, a music recital. And I wanted to participate #id:1f0
Ayumi (Sad): I wasn't used to being in front of an audience, it was gonna be my first time #id:1f1
Ayumi (Sad): And I was really nervous #id:1f2
Ayumi (Sad): So when my turn came, I walked over the microphone shaking #id:1f3
Ayumi (Sad): I grabbed it and started singing… #id:1f4
