~ animate("Ayumi", "pulse")
Ayumi (Sad): And I felt something bit my foot #id:1f6
Ayumi (Sad): I dropped the mic and it fell in my foot! #id:1f7

main_character: oooh, that's nasty #id:1f8

Ayumi (Sad): when I kneeled down to grab the mic, I saw my friend laughing #id:1f9
Ayumi (Sad): and I was just a kid, so of course… It hurt me #id:1fa
Ayumi (Sad): I started singing again, and when I watched him him, he was still laughing! #id:1fb
Ayumi (Sad): I started sobbing. #id:1fc
Ayumi (Sad): And the more I cried, the harder he laughed! #id:1fd

main_character: Baka… #id:1fe

